<title>CHINA: China Marine first half net up 6.3 pct.</title>
<headline>China Marine first half net up 6.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1997 (in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1996 figures):</p>
<p>    Turnover	   1,647.88	 vs  1,358.86</p>
<p>    Net Profit	    99.76	 vs     93.87</p>
<p>    Earnings per share   0.382 yuan vs	0.467 yuan</p>
<p>    Net assets per share 3.58 yuan  vs	3.82 yuan</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding 261.27 million   vs    200.98 million</p>
<p>Company name: China International Marine Containers Co Ltd .</p>
<p>Note: The unaudited results were published in a report in the Shenzhen-based Securities Times on Saturday.</p>
<p>Company made three-for-ten bonus share issue in the first half of 1997.</p>
<p>The company did not specify whether the results were compiled under Chinese or international accounting standards.</p>
<p>(US$1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
</text>
